<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="MK">
<l>vāḻā maiyiṉ vaḻitavak keṭṭup</l>
<l>pāḻā yiṉaniṉ pakaivar tēe</l>
<l>meḻā attō ḷimiḻmuḻakkiṉ</l>
<l>māattā ḷuyarmaruppiṟ</l>
<l>kaṭuñciṉatta kaḷiṟuparappi</l>
<l>virikaṭal viyaṉṟāṉaiyoṭu</l>
<l>murukuṟaḻap pakaittalaicceṉ</l>
<l>ṟakalvicumpi ṉārppimiḻap</l>
<l>peyaluṟaḻak kaṇaicitaṟip</l>
<l>palapuravi nīṟukaippa</l>
<l>vaḷainarala vayirārppap</l>
<l>pīṭaḻiyak kaṭantaṭṭavar</l>
<l>nāṭaḻiya veyilvauvic</l>
<l>cuṟṟamoṭu tūvaṟuttaliṟ</l>
<l>ceṟṟa tevvar niṉvaḻi naṭappa</l>
<l>viyaṉkaṇ mutupoḻiṉ maṇṭila muṟṟi</l>
<l>yaraciyal piḻaiyā taṟaneṟi kāṭṭip</l>
<l>periyōr ceṉṟa vaṭivaḻip piḻaiyātu</l>
<l>kuṭamutaṟ ṟōṉṟiya toṉṟutoḻu piṟaiyiṉ</l>
<l>vaḻivaḻic ciṟakkaniṉ valampaṭu koṟṟaṅ</l>
<l>kuṇamutaṟ ṟōṉṟiya vāriruṇ matiyiṟ</l>
<l>ṟēyvaṉa keṭukaniṉ ṟevva rākka</l>
<l>muyarnilai yulaka mamiḻtoṭu peṟiṉum</l>
<l>poycē ṇīṅkiya vāynaṭ piṉaiyē</l>
<l>muḻaṅkukaṭa lēṇi malartalai yulakamo</l>
<l>ṭuyarnta tēettu viḻumiyōr variṉum</l>
<l>pakaivark kañcip paṇintoḻu kalaiyē</l>
      </lg>
